#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:3
#: 93f62a3eebd14056b20a0e7f41d86051
msgid "晶格应变（Lattice Strain）"
msgstr "Lattice Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:5
#: 7d5690cdd97b47fb8677cbdd768e11c8
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:7
#: d48cf04e6c8948a4bc3941be3e7e8d4e
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:9
#: 321f8312a702414ab6d56e45025e00d9
msgid ""
"沿输入晶胞的晶格矢量 $\\mathbf a$、$\\mathbf b$、$\\mathbf c$ "
"扫描法向工程应变。可生成三条单轴路径、三组双轴网格、一个三轴网格、各向同性路径，或只组合用户指定的晶格轴。"
msgstr ""
"Scan normal engineering strain along lattice vectors $\\mathbf a$, $\\mathbf b$, and "
"$\\mathbf c$ of the input cell. The card can generate three uniaxial paths, three "
"biaxial grids, one triaxial grid, an isotropic path, or combinations of only the "
"lattice axes selected by the user."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:11
#: 2b6870a2a6204b038afe66c27d419dff
msgid "这里的 `a / b / c` 是晶格矢量，不是 Cartesian `X / Y / Z`。对于旋转或非正交晶胞，两者不能混用。"
msgstr ""
"Here `a / b / c` refer to lattice vectors, not Cartesian `X / Y / Z`. The two "
"coordinate systems are not interchangeable for rotated or non-orthogonal cells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:13
#: 7d7d87da794a4162b293b8ef924a324b
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:15
#: 0912ff6d950a4dfd8036a930854b6edc
msgid "给定百分数 $s_a,s_b,s_c$，工程应变为"
msgstr "For percentages $s_a,s_b,s_c$, the engineering strain is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:17
#: 3a14f1c747ee4e27a9934b5f8a178ee8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\epsilon_i=\\frac{s_i}{100},\\qquad i\\in\\{a,b,c\\}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:21
#: ac0bcc6e76e647c5bd5d0d7cd60a9bdc
msgid "程序分别缩放晶胞矩阵的三条行向量："
msgstr "The program scales the three row vectors of the cell matrix independently:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:23
#: ecbc82cb82d84c159584cc48e4be2368
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf a'=(1+\\epsilon_a)\\mathbf a,\\quad\n"
"\\mathbf b'=(1+\\epsilon_b)\\mathbf b,\\quad\n"
"\\mathbf c'=(1+\\epsilon_c)\\mathbf c.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:29
#: c585b83bf884446a8ef201c1f7955b1f
msgid "原子分数坐标保持不变，因此 Cartesian 坐标随晶胞作仿射变换。应变必须大于 `-100%`，否则对应晶格矢量会坍缩或反向。"
msgstr ""
"Atomic fractional coordinates remain unchanged, so Cartesian coordinates undergo the "
"same affine transformation as the cell. Strain must be greater than `-100%`; "
"otherwise, the corresponding lattice vector would collapse or reverse direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:31
#: 633bc117d3584cec9eba11dd192961c6
msgid "模式与输出数量"
msgstr "Modes and Output Counts"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:33
#: 40925a7d7d004d548aab9edd883c9308
msgid "设三组范围分别含 $N_a$、$N_b$、$N_c$ 个点："
msgstr "Let the three ranges contain $N_a$, $N_b$, and $N_c$ points, respectively:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: ebe4f8a93fa2418c9b9e6c5608aecf2d
msgid "模式"
msgstr "Mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 9195b75739b9414fae7c615d4aba23e9
msgid "实际生成内容"
msgstr "Generated states"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 0c4fea6edeb241f0aa6ebdfc309bde1f
msgid "去重前数量"
msgstr "Count before deduplication"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 58f8f3bdf8a14b7ba09fd48b1c6344a3
msgid "单轴路径"
msgstr "Uniaxial paths"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 8616679d2a234b1ea7926e5e0a84092f
msgid "分别扫描 $a$、$b$、$c$"
msgstr "Scan $a$, $b$, and $c$ separately"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 68df14f42fe94d1b94a331194b332cd2
msgid "$N_a+N_b+N_c$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: cfd1ae5c29e84719afa2116e6daaa26e
msgid "双轴网格"
msgstr "Biaxial grids"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 7800c31dc1084e0c8c98b9ac40b6b354
msgid "合并 $ab$、$ac$、$bc$ 三个网格"
msgstr "Combine the $ab$, $ac$, and $bc$ grids"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: bd815944f55f45db89ba5cfa40074ea6
msgid "$N_aN_b+N_aN_c+N_bN_c$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 651c272bfad940aa95ff281b5ac9aaa2
msgid "三轴网格"
msgstr "Triaxial grid"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: f207b5c972bf4dfa974eeb4e844bfcee
msgid "联合组合 $a$、$b$、$c$"
msgstr "Combine $a$, $b$, and $c$ jointly"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 12fead6f9295478d97f98e057eeb00b7
msgid "$N_aN_bN_c$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 8fa6f894dcc94548b4ef5f4999cd353c
msgid "各向同性路径"
msgstr "Isotropic path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 681896285dc445bc846c3196e6c245c4
msgid "使用第一组范围，令 $s_a=s_b=s_c$"
msgstr "Use the first range and set $s_a=s_b=s_c$"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 392927c5be9b4d3da4e5960c73eab22c
msgid "$N_a$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 37eb84c384cf4d93b7170fb71dbbf454
msgid "指定晶格轴"
msgstr "Selected lattice axes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: a59c679d1d9842ba958280a520275beb
msgid "只组合选中的轴"
msgstr "Combine only the selected axes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md
#: 0e434516c2cd448baea74aa46b172357
msgid "所选范围点数的乘积"
msgstr "Product of the selected range sizes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:43
#: bdaad794537149ddbed4e473bd2203d6
msgid "不同路径可能得到相同的应变向量。例如单轴扫描的三条路径都包含 `0%`，对应的都是原始结构。程序会按照 $(s_a,s_b,s_c)$ 去重，只输出一次完全相同的应变状态。"
msgstr ""
"Different paths can produce the same strain vector. For example, all three uniaxial "
"paths include `0%`, and each of those points represents the original structure. The "
"program deduplicates by $(s_a,s_b,s_c)$ and outputs an identical strain state only "
"once."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:45
#: e226d8f86e824bc880f44b4c5f54bfab
msgid "默认三组范围均为 `-5%～5%`、步长 `1%`，每组 11 个点。去重后的默认数量为："
msgstr ""
"By default, all three ranges run from `-5%` to `5%` in steps of `1%`, giving 11 "
"points per range. After deduplication, the default counts are:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:47
#: ec9b3baad9bd4544bb7ff6fde5ae8e32
msgid "单轴路径：31 个；"
msgstr "Uniaxial paths: 31."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:48
#: 1c7ce7ea11f642659f237afb166cc4d6
msgid "双轴网格：331 个；"
msgstr "Biaxial grids: 331."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:49
#: 58e488416c6145388a44423e6b65e332
msgid "三轴网格：1331 个；"
msgstr "Triaxial grid: 1,331."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:50
#: 65e2a3e21a394337a24d20aa78024297
msgid "各向同性路径：11 个。"
msgstr "Isotropic path: 11."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:52
#: c0e8ec7e2e354b1da45179a38b2a4d7f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"若输入结构数为 $N_\\mathrm{in}$，每个输入的去重后数量为 $N_\\mathrm{per}$，则总输出为 "
"$N_\\mathrm{in}N_\\mathrm{per}$。界面摘要会随模式和范围实时显示该数量。"
msgstr ""
"If there are $N_\\mathrm{in}$ input structures and $N_\\mathrm{per}$ deduplicated "
"states per input, the total output count is $N_\\mathrm{in}N_\\mathrm{per}$. The "
"interface summary updates this count as the mode and ranges change."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:54
#: 334508523bb947f5b41aa57144f28d22
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:56
#: 8154c5900285436797eda607c8b25132
msgid "扫描模式（axes）"
msgstr "Scan Mode (axes)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:58
#: af3f66e55d5d419da187b15ac352eb4b
msgid "默认 `uniaxial`。可选值及含义："
msgstr "Default `uniaxial`. The available values are:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:60
#: e224f9049e6646b3b0ba5c08f5ca0870
msgid "`uniaxial`：晶格 $a$、$b$、$c$ 三条单轴路径；"
msgstr "`uniaxial`: Three uniaxial paths along lattice vectors $a$, $b$, and $c$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:61
#: 9cdde12643f4464893b407db9a94b6d4
msgid "`biaxial`：$ab$、$ac$、$bc$ 三组双轴网格；"
msgstr "`biaxial`: Three biaxial grids, $ab$, $ac$, and $bc$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:62
#: be616da8f33445e1bce4597e6481cacb
msgid "`triaxial`：$abc$ 三轴联合网格；"
msgstr "`triaxial`: One joint $abc$ triaxial grid."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:63
#: ae4e6d61629a4215aaa6e800be1a9813
msgid "`isotropic`：三轴使用同一个应变值；"
msgstr "`isotropic`: Use one common strain value on all three axes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:64
#: 4e0e73498f2f468b9ab07465b020f9c4
msgid "自定义轴：序列化为 `X`、`XY`、`XZ` 等旧格式，界面显示为 `a`、`ab`、`ac`。"
msgstr ""
"Custom axes: serialized in the legacy forms `X`, `XY`, `XZ`, and so on, while the "
"interface displays `a`, `ab`, and `ac`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:66
#: 2340493a3d2044058c6e60c22c22dc3a
msgid "自定义轴不能重复，例如 `aa` 无效。"
msgstr "A custom axis selection cannot contain duplicates; for example, `aa` is invalid."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:68
#: 0cff6685b864463d80473633b409a99a
msgid "晶格 a 范围（x_range）"
msgstr "Lattice a Range (x_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:70
#: dd51e909bcad40868a1c123aa86bfb7e
msgid "默认 `(-5, 5, 1)`，依次为最小值、最大值、步长，单位 `%`。控制晶格矢量 $\\mathbf a$；各向同性模式也只读取这一组范围作为三轴共同应变。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(-5, 5, 1)` in `%`, containing the minimum, maximum, and step in that order."
" It controls lattice vector $\\mathbf a$. Isotropic mode also reads only this range "
"and applies it as the common strain on all three axes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:72
#: 61ca1ff8711c4c2dba2d52f9958f9afc
msgid "晶格 b 范围（y_range）"
msgstr "Lattice b Range (y_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:74
#: 38d74cdb3833467aa65697659081ec57
msgid "默认 `(-5, 5, 1)`，控制晶格矢量 $\\mathbf b$。各向同性模式下不生效，因此界面会隐藏。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(-5, 5, 1)`. Controls lattice vector $\\mathbf b$. It is unused and hidden "
"in isotropic mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:76
#: e6d5d49989fe400298599c6ebd7ccc49
msgid "晶格 c 范围（z_range）"
msgstr "Lattice c Range (z_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:78
#: 0342e154838f47299eded7372fe45cfa
msgid "默认 `(-5, 5, 1)`，控制晶格矢量 $\\mathbf c$。各向同性模式下不生效，因此界面会隐藏。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(-5, 5, 1)`. Controls lattice vector $\\mathbf c$. It is unused and hidden "
"in isotropic mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:80
#: 156f27e908884819a411678b30fc841a
msgid "三组范围都允许反向填写最小值和最大值，程序会按升序生成；步长必须为正数。"
msgstr ""
"All three ranges accept reversed minimum and maximum values; the program generates "
"points in ascending order. The step must be positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:82
#: 2275aea955b140848f039187563589c5
msgid "保持识别出的分子刚性（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Preserve Detected Molecular Rigidity (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:84
#: c471c540537e4282a16134c2625b9e18
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，程序先施加晶胞仿射应变，再恢复检测到的分子团簇内部几何。周期网络和 MOF 的识别结果应结合实际结构抽查。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, the program first applies the affine cell strain "
"and then restores the internal geometry of detected molecular clusters. Inspect "
"representative structures when using this option with periodic networks or MOFs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:86
#: 808bd97054bb458cb0c0d0316f829c4d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:88
#: 105c009d466a4c9e8850c8e79136e9a7
msgid "生成三条近平衡单轴路径"
msgstr "Generate Three Near-Equilibrium Uniaxial Paths"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:90
#: 479029a95bf54916b1bf93a7709726b6
msgid "若训练集缺少晶格法向应变附近的结构，可设置："
msgstr "If the training set lacks structures near normal lattice strain, use:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:92
#: d2acd1848e604962b7eb4fc060907e20
msgid "扫描模式：单轴路径（a、b、c）；"
msgstr "Scan mode: uniaxial paths (a, b, and c)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:93
#: 8889f260606748b5af639fbdcc841faa
msgid "三组范围：`-2%～2%`，步长 `1%`；"
msgstr "All three ranges: `-2%` to `2%` with a `1%` step."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:94
#: 07a0678493c043fdadb15b72173fe299
msgid "保持识别出的分子刚性：关闭。"
msgstr "Preserve detected molecular rigidity: off."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:96
#: ba41cdc9cbe44aa8a795b667899c00ab
msgid ""
"每组有 5 个点，三条路径去重前为 15 个；三个 `0%` 状态合并后，每个输入生成 13 "
"个独特结构。生成后应检查体积、最近邻距离及所需应力分量，再决定是否进入标注流程。"
msgstr ""
"Each range has five points, so the three paths contain 15 states before "
"deduplication. Merging the three `0%` states leaves 13 unique structures per input. "
"After generation, inspect volume, nearest-neighbor distances, and the required stress"
" components before sending the structures for labeling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:98
#: 4dda3956ec604603b1ca13daa7c993e2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellStrainCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"axes\": \"uniaxial\",\n"
"    \"x_range\": [-2.0, 2.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"y_range\": [-2.0, 2.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"z_range\": [-2.0, 2.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:112
#: 5401550a0d9d4f0d9cfccf577d0688a4
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:114
#: a81e8b6e12d24be6a37b3b9f00dc7787
msgid "**为什么单轴模式不是只沿一个方向？** “单轴路径”会枚举 $a$、$b$、$c$ 三条路径。若只需要一条，选择“指定晶格轴”并输入 `a`、`b` 或 `c`。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does uniaxial mode not use only one direction?** `Uniaxial paths` enumerates "
"separate paths along $a$, $b$, and $c$. To use only one, choose `Selected lattice "
"axes` and enter `a`, `b`, or `c`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:116
#: 5e325ac202674ac19f5932bef8df1067
msgid "**为什么输出数少于三个网格点数之和？** 不同路径重叠得到的相同应变向量只输出一次，最常见的是 `(0%,0%,0%)` 原始结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the output count smaller than the sum of the three path sizes?** Identical "
"strain vectors produced by overlapping paths are output only once. The most common "
"overlap is the original `(0%,0%,0%)` structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:118
#: c6972000c0c54ab987593cac6d58b009
msgid "**为什么各向同性模式只显示一组范围？** 三条晶格矢量使用同一个应变值，因此只需要共同范围。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does isotropic mode show only one range?** All three lattice vectors use the "
"same strain value, so only one common range is needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:120
#: 8a2f73c2b0a54d9e9ee9be3c5b24e0a2
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:122
#: f2f8241a8e4b4f8397d0b23d0bf774f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Str(a={sa}%,b={sb}%,c={sc}%)`，记录每条晶格矢量的工程应变。"
msgstr "`Str(a={sa}%,b={sb}%,c={sc}%)` records the engineering strain on each lattice vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:124
#: ecb542bc08144626862bde93ad9cd8a8
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-strain-card.md:126
#: 6f60d59f0a09493c94d3739d0a7704cd
msgid "无随机性。相同输入和参数会产生相同的去重后应变结构。"
msgstr ""
"There is no randomness. Identical inputs and parameters produce the same deduplicated"
" strain structures."

#~ msgid "`x_range` = `[-2, 2, 1]` （-2% 到 +2%，每 1% 一步）"
#~ msgstr "`x_range` = `[-2, 2, 1]` (-2% to +2% in 1% steps)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, "
#~ "1.0)`。格式是 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，单位 %。只有 `Axes` "
#~ "激活的方向才生效；isotropic 模式只认 x_range。步长越小、范围越宽，输出的结构就越多。"
#~ msgstr ""
